# Project Conventions

- Language: TypeScript strict, no `any` types
- Styling: Tailwind CSS v4 utility classes, no external CSS files
- Imports: use `@/` alias (maps to `./src/`)
- Components: functional components only, no class components
- State: React hooks + Context API, no external state libraries
- UI text: Spanish for user-facing content, English for code/comments
- Never commit `.env` — secrets go in GitHub Actions secrets
- Test builds locally with `npm run build` before pushing
